change_type: instructions   changelog: quickintel-scan v1.0.2  - Added support for Solana payments (SPL USDC) via the x402 protocol—scan payments can now be made on Solana in addition to EVM chains. - Updated documentation and payment flow sections to describe the Solana (SVM) process, including partially signed SPL transfers and fee payer logic. - Expanded the list of payment networks in the overview to clearly include Solana. - Clarified that Base is recommended for EVM payments (lowest fees), while Solana is also now supported.

